-> -= - => == = != !
---
ARROW 0..2 "->"
WHITESPACE 2..3 " "
MINUS_ASSIGN 3..5 "-="
WHITESPACE 5..6 " "
MINUS 6..7 "-"
WHITESPACE 7..8 " "
FAT_ARROW 8..10 "=>"
WHITESPACE 10..11 " "
EQ 11..13 "=="
WHITESPACE 13..14 " "
ASSIGN 14..15 "="
WHITESPACE 15..16 " "
NEQ 16..18 "!="
WHITESPACE 18..19 " "
BANG 19..20 "!"
WHITESPACE 20..21 "\n"
